# CHANGELOG

Format: <date> - <author (username or mail or both)> - [role] <change description>

# To 3.4

* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [pcs] Fix package lists from Docker checks: resource-agents added on RHEL (IPaddr2 and other OCF agents were missing), resource-agents on Debian 13 and fence-agents-base on Ubuntu (resource-agents-base and fence-agents do not exist on all versions), use pcs cluster destroy --yes with pcs 0.12 (Debian 13, Ubuntu 26.04).
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [powerman] powerman.conf readable by the powerman group on Suse (daemon runs as powerman user).
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [loki] Fix role failing on Debian and Ubuntu (loki package user has no loki group).
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [rsyslog] Use the distribution work directory on Debian and Ubuntu (/var/spool/rsyslog), keeping its ownership.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [logrotate] Include /usr/etc/logrotate.d on OpenSuse Leap 16, where packages install their logrotate files.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [slurm] Fix Suse package names (libmunge2 instead of munge-libs, mariadb is the server package).
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [all roles] Group firewalld tasks of each role in a block (os_firewall, firewall tag), with a rescue failing with an explanatory message (firewalld not running, python3-firewall missing, or set os_firewall to false) instead of the raw module error: dhcp_server, dns_server, grafana, haproxy, http_proxy, http_server, keepalived, loki, nfs, pcs, podman, prometheus, pxe_stack, rsyslog, slurm, sshd, time.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [update_reboot] Document that hosts are only rebooted when packages were updated, boolean conditions, remove role specific lint configuration, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [users] Fix README example (unquoted ! password is a YAML tag), replace crypt based hash example by openssl, boolean condition, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [xfs_quota] Fix README (outdated variable names), document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [time] Fix clients never getting a time server from networks services (main network name looked up with surrounding new lines), fix time_chronyd_options failing on Debian and Ubuntu (/etc/default/chrony DAEMON_OPTS, /etc/sysconfig/chronyd does not exist), check chrony.conf with chronyd -p before writing it, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [rsyslog] Fix clients never forwarding logs to servers defined in networks services (same main network lookup bug).
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [inventory] CI inventory and services documentation use the dns4, pxe4, ntp4 and log4 service keys.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [sshd] Fix settings overridden by distribution drop-in files read first (for example 50-cloud-init.conf on Ubuntu), the file is now 00-bluebanquise.conf, fix sshd failing to start when yes/no values are YAML booleans (written as True/False), check the configuration with sshd -t before restarting sshd, fix OpenSuse Leap 16 (no /etc/ssh/sshd_config, it was going to be created with only an Include line), restart sshd when the Include line is added, FQCN, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [ssh_client] Restore network selection (ssh_client_global_network / ssh_client_network write Hostname %h-<network>, documented but not generated anymore), write hosts settings before global ones (global settings silently overrode hosts ones, ssh keeps the first value), only write hosts having settings, create .ssh owned by the user (was root owned for sudo users), remove UseRoaming (removed from OpenSSH, breaks ssh) and unused ssh_client_enable_jump, rewrite README.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [ssh_remote_keys] Use ansible_facts instead of injected facts, rewrite README, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [slurm] Fix local MariaDB accounting setup failing when root has a password (for example set by the mariadb role): login as root with slurm_accounting_mysql_login_password, after a passwordless unix socket attempt, fix OpenSuse Leap 16 accounting packages (python313-PyMySQL), fix injected fact and non boolean conditions.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [rsyslog] Fix server replacing the distribution /etc/logrotate.d/rsyslog, so that local logs (syslog, auth.log...) were not rotated anymore (remote logs now rotated by /etc/logrotate.d/rsyslog-remote, and the distribution file restored on upgraded servers), rotate local files written by the role which are not rotated by Debian, Ubuntu and Suse (messages, secure, maillog, cron, spooler, boot.log), create the rsyslog work directory (/var/lib/rsyslog does not exist on Debian and Ubuntu, disk queues and imjournal state were not working), tag profile includes always, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [repositories] Fix Debian 13 simple repositories (deb822 flat repository: Suites ./ without components, trusted), omit components when suites ends with /, fix Suse auto_import_keys taking the disable_gpg_check value, fix Suse repository description being the whole repository dictionary, fix double slash in simple repositories URL when no repositories environment is set, rename repositories_j2_simple_url to repositories_simple_url, remove unused yum clean handler, fix README (Suse example used baseurl instead of repo, Debian 13 deb822 example), document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [singularity] Fix singularity_bind_path never used (bind paths were hardcoded), now a list, remove the image driver directive (removed from SingularityCE 4), remove dead OS variables include and unused variables (singularity_allow_user_image, singularity_protected_image_mode), make package list overridable, rewrite README (packages from Sylabs GitHub releases, Apptainer not managed), document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [rasdaemon] Honor bb_enable_services/bb_start_services (rasdaemon_enable_services/rasdaemon_start_services), document supported distributions and variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [pxe_stack] Add OpenSuse Leap 16 deployment, using the new Agama installer (JSON profile generated per equipment profile, osdeploy/opensuse_16.ipxe booting the installer live system), Leap 15 AutoYaST deployment unchanged, fix Leap 16 iso URLs in netboots_installer.yml, fix apache service name on Suse (apache2), run bluebanquise-bootset, bluebanquise-netboots-installer and bluebanquise-diskless from bluebanquise-venv (PyYAML was not installed on Suse), fix tftp drop-in comment line (invalid systemd line), set /etc/bluebanquise files and folders owner to root, remove dead files (Trash and DGX templates, unauthenticated bluebanquise-automate daemon never deployed), add a Leap 16 host to the CI inventory, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [prometheus] Fix TLS and basic authentication never applied (web.yml was generated but not loaded, --web.config.file is now added automatically, and web.yml checked with promtool), fix snmp_exporter failing on first run when its configuration is provided by prometheus_server_snmp_exporter_raw_configuration, fix client failing on hosts not part of any prometheus_exporters_groups_to_scrape group, fix service_raw_configuration lists rendered as a Python list in exporters service files, restart Prometheus when alerts files change and check them with promtool, generate alertmanager.yml with to_nice_yaml instead of a hand written YAML macro, open Karma port with prometheus_firewall_open, use firewalld ports instead of a custom alertmanager service and firewall reload, remove never working prometheus_server_launch_parameters ($PROMETHEUS_OPTIONS drop-in never generated), make packages lists overridable and snmp generator dependencies distribution specific, remove dead code (am_executor, unused bb_exporter and nhc_exporter scripts, unused scrape variables), fix README (modbus variable name, launch parameters), document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [powerman] Fix role not working at all (relied on j2_bb_equipments, j2_hosts_range and j2_bb_nodes_profiles from the removed core vars plugin), rewrite powerman.conf generation (one ipmipower device per set of IPMI credentials, one node line per host so that hosts and BMCs are always paired correctly), make powerman.conf readable only by root and the powerman daemon (contains BMC passwords), add powerman_restrict_to_group, fix service enabled value (yes/no string), make package list overridable, document variables.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [pcs] Fix role crashing on Debian 13 (no variables file) and failing on Ubuntu (resource-agents package does not exist anymore, resource-agents-base), fix properties and stonith-enabled checks never matching pcs 0.11+ output (name=value), so that they were set and the configuration pushed at each run, fix location constraints pushed at each run, fix stonith prefers constraint never applied and avoids constraint failing when not set, push configuration once instead of once per host, fail clearly on Suse (pcs not packaged), destroy the Debian default cluster on Debian too, handle pcsd, corosync and pacemaker with the services pattern and service tag, exact match of registered nodes (ha1 matched ha10), document variables, replace crypt based password hash examples by openssl.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [podman] Major upgrade (3.0.0): configure registries and containers.conf through drop-in files instead of replacing distribution files (the replaced containers.conf used the frozen k8s.gcr.io pause image and CNI settings), write storage.conf only when podman_storage_driver is set, remove files written by previous versions, fix local registry service ignoring podman_local_registry_port and podman_local_registry_dir (reversed mappings), run it unprivileged on the default network, load its image only once, fix firewall zone variable (ha_firewall_zone), set podman_users subuid/subgid entries without overwriting files (duplicated root and lxd entries overlapping useradd ranges), drop per-user configuration files, remove podman-compose (EPEL only on RHEL) and OS vars files (podman_packages_to_install now overridable), reject variables of previous versions, rewrite README.
* 2026-10-30 - oxedions, Claude - [loki] Major upgrade (2.0.0): Loki 3 configuration (tsdb index, schema v13, the Loki 2 configuration did not start anymore with Loki 3), replace Promtail (end of life) by Alloy to receive rsyslog traffic (same labels: job, host, app, level), use packaged systemd units and users (loki_users and loki_groups removed), add loki_retention_period, validate configurations before writing them, open Loki port only when listening on a non loopback address, stop Promtail and remove its files on upgraded hosts, reject variables of previous versions, rewrite README with upgrade notes.
