* 2026-10-29 - oxedions, Claude - [local_configuration] Fix kernel version lock doing nothing on Debian 13 (kernel name used as a regex, + never matched), make local_configuration_kernel_version_meta_packages overridable as documented (was in vars) and derive Debian arch (amd64/arm64), apply RHEL kernel parameters to all kernels including future ones (grubby --update-kernel=ALL) and add hw_console on RHEL too, keep kernel parameters order on Debian/Ubuntu/Suse (sorting could reorder console=), fix sudoers_logging crash without ansible_user, AppArmor: keep distribution profiles as shipped when enforcing (no more apparmor-profiles nor mass aa-enforce), really unload profiles when disabled (aa-teardown), fix tagged runs, merge identical Ubuntu/Suse task files, README: openssl passwd -6 instead of removed Python crypt, document variables.
* 2026-10-29 - oxedions, Claude - [interconnect] OpenSM settings now written in distribution native files (subnet manager setup failed on Debian, Ubuntu and Leap: edited configuration files do not exist there), remove OpenSM port auto-detection (required an ACTIVE port, impossible before a subnet manager runs, and used the node GUID instead of the port GUID) in favor of distribution default ports and new interconnect_ofed_subnet_manager_guids, restart OpenSM on settings changes, stop managing rdma-ndd (started by udev, not installed on Leap: client setup failed), fix tagged runs, verified package names on all distributions, document variables.
