* 2026-10-29 - oxedions, Claude - [http_server] Fix http_server_listen stopping Apache on first run (restarted before the distribution Listen 80 was disabled, address already in use), fix port only listen entries (integer crashed the role, string became Listen <port>:80), make http_server_listen reversible (Listen 80 restored and custom listen file removed when unset), open custom listen ports in the firewall, check configuration (apachectl, apache2ctl or start_apache2 -t depending on the distribution) before restarting Apache, fail clearly when http_server_modules is used on RedHat (no a2enmod), Suse: replace the full copy of default-server.conf by a drop-in only allowing folders listing, fix --tags template on Suse, remove undocumented http_server_listen_disable_default from README, remove duplicate Ubuntu vars, document variables.
